TextFlux Korean Document Measurement
====================================

This repository contains two kinds of content, kept in separate directories.

Original work
-------------
Everything except vendor/ is original work by the maintainers of this
repository, licensed under Apache-2.0. See LICENSE.

  docs/       measurement records, pipeline description, parameter rationale
  scripts/    measurement and review tooling
  cases/      test manifests
  examples/   synthetic demo form and masks
  results/    measurement evidence
  runtime/    container image assembly, dependency pins, local-path runner

Vendored third-party work
-------------------------
vendor/textflux/ is a snapshot of the upstream TextFlux project:

  https://github.com/yyyyyxie/textflux
  commit c791924acc4a93d48021c3731a75fada805cc501
  recorded in vendor/textflux/UPSTREAM_REVISION

It is included verbatim, with checkpoints and evaluation weights excluded.
The snapshot carries no upstream git history; it is the file tree at that
commit. Its own license and attribution files are preserved in place:

  vendor/textflux/LICENSE          upstream Apache-2.0
  vendor/textflux/LICENSE-MODEL    FLUX.1-dev model license
  vendor/textflux/NOTICE           upstream provenance and modifications

vendor/textflux/diffusers/ is a modified diffusers tree shipped by upstream.
It is required by TextFlux and cannot be replaced with a PyPI release.

Model weights
-------------
No model weights are contained in this repository. FLUX.1-Fill-dev and the
TextFlux checkpoint are obtained separately by
runtime/scripts/download_models.py and stored in a workspace directory outside
version control. Their licenses and access terms are set by their providers.
